<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Zero Marketplace - Discover Plugins & LitComponents</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Quicksand:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
            background: #181a20;
            color: #e0e0e0;
        }
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, #1e3c72 0%, #2a5298 100%), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461749280684-dccba630e2f6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1500&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
            padding: 80px 0 60px 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: #fff;
            position: relative;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .search-bar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .search-bar input {
            width: 350px;
            padding: 12px 18px;
            border-radius: 30px 0 0 30px;
            border: none;
            font-size: 1rem;
            outline: none;
        }
        .search-bar button {
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 0 30px 30px 0;
            border: none;
            background: #ffb347;
            color: #222;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }
        .search-bar button:hover {
            background: #ff9800;
        }
        .featured-section {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 40px auto 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #ffb347;
        }
        .featured-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }
        .plugin-card {
            background: #23272f;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            padding: 24px 18px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        }
        .plugin-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.03);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
        }
        .plugin-card img {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            object-fit: contain;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .plugin-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .plugin-card p {
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            color: #b0b0b0;
        }
        .categories {
            margin: 60px auto 0 auto;
            max-width: 1100px;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        .categories-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 18px;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .category {
            background: #2a2d34;
            color: #ffb347;
            border-radius: 30px;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
        }
        .category:hover {
            background: #ffb347;
            color: #23272f;
        }
        .testimonials {
            background: #23272f;
            margin: 60px 0 0 0;
            padding: 40px 0;
        }
        .testimonials .section-title {
            color: #fff;
        }
        .testimonial-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 30px;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .testimonial {
            background: #181a20;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px 18px;
            max-width: 340px;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
        }
        .testimonial .user {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .testimonial .user img {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin-right: 12px;
        }
        .testimonial .user span {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffb347;
        }
        .footer {
            background: #181a20;
            color: #b0b0b0;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 24px 0 12px 0;
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
            .featured-section, .categories { padding: 0 8px; }
            .plugin-card { padding: 18px 8px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="hero">
        <h1>Zero Marketplace</h1>
        <p>Discover, install, and share the best plugins and LitComponents for your next project.<br>Power up your workflow with a vibrant, open marketplace.</p>
        <div class="search-bar">
            <input type="text" placeholder="Search plugins, components, or categories...">
            <button><i class="fas fa-search"></i> Search</button>
        </div>
        <a href="#featured" style="color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;font-size:1.1rem;">Browse Marketplace <i class="fas fa-arrow-down"></i></a>
    </div>

    <div class="featured-section" id="featured">
        <div class="section-title">Featured Plugins & Components</div>
        <div class="featured-grid">
            <div class="plugin-card">
                <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/1828/1828919.png" alt="UI Kit">
                <h3>UI Kit Pro</h3>
                <p>Premium set of ready-to-use UI LitComponents for rapid prototyping and beautiful apps.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="plugin-card">
                <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2721/2721297.png" alt="Charts">
                <h3>Chart Master</h3>
                <p>Interactive charting components for analytics dashboards and data visualization.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="plugin-card">
                <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/753/753345.png" alt="Auth">
                <h3>AuthX</h3>
                <p>Plug-and-play authentication and user management for your web apps.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="plugin-card">
                <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/1828/1828961.png" alt="Theme Switcher">
                <h3>Theme Switcher</h3>
                <p>Let users toggle between light and dark modes with a single component.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="categories">
        <div class="section-title">Popular Categories</div>
        <div class="categories-list">
            <div class="category"><i class="fas fa-paint-brush"></i> UI/UX</div>
            <div class="category"><i class="fas fa-chart-bar"></i> Data Visualization</div>
            <div class="category"><i class="fas fa-user-shield"></i> Authentication</div>
            <div class="category"><i class="fas fa-cogs"></i> Utilities</div>
            <div class="category"><i class="fas fa-language"></i> Internationalization</div>
            <div class="category"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i> Performance</div>
            <div class="category"><i class="fas fa-code"></i> Developer Tools</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="testimonials">
        <div class="section-title">What Developers Say</div>
        <div class="testimonial-list">
            <div class="testimonial">
                <div class="user">
                    <img src="https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/32.jpg" alt="User">
                    <span>Alex P.</span>
                </div>
                "Zero Marketplace made it super easy to find and integrate high-quality LitComponents. My productivity has doubled!"
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial">
                <div class="user">
                    <img src="https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/44.jpg" alt="User">
                    <span>Priya S.</span>
                </div>
                "The plugin variety is amazing. I found everything from authentication to beautiful charts in one place."
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial">
                <div class="user">
                    <img src="https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/65.jpg" alt="User">
                    <span>Chen W.</span>
                </div>
                "A must-have for any modern web developer. The search and install experience is seamless!"
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Zero Marketplace &mdash; Built for creators, by creators. | <a href="#" style="color:#ffb347;">Contact</a> | <a href="#" style="color:#ffb347;">GitHub</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
